{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"じやん！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/03/16/3864655/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"猫耳～～～  (๑･ิټ･ิ๑)にゃんごろにゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみ猫だよよろちく"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/03/16/3864655/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/03/16/3864655/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/03/16/3864655/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぷり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかわたしがこんな髪型するのが珍しいからかときたまみんなからは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「今日は何か生えてるのね、笑」......的なこと言われたりもしたりしたけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これは、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"猫です！！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"猫の、耳なの！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それを髪の毛で見事に再現したの！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかあみあみ族様たちに、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"卒業おめでとう言われすぎて改めてわたくしはもう学生ではない事を実感した。。。びぇ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やだーーーーーー！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"社会人になることによって一番嫌なこと\nなんだと思う？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/03/16/3864655/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほらそこのあなた考えてみて？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学割きかなくなること。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/03/16/3864655/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまいを全力で睨むわたしとらりん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば今日やたらとらりんテンション高かったなあ。。❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そこであみ言っちゃったの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「良かったら落ち着いてみて？」って。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......ちょっと面白くない？？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"低姿勢に見せつつうったえてみる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このセリフ飛鳥がこの間ふとあみに言ってきて面白かったからさっそく盗んだ❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなも使っていいよ全然。全然いいよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーーいいいい遠慮しないで。ね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみあみは 、どこのカラコン使ってますかー ？\nいまブラウンのカラコン を探しているので 、参考にさせてください"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみは、リンダってやつ使ってるよ！！(^_-)自然な感じでオススメ❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみあみは洋楽好き？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"洋楽も聞くよたまに！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"One Direction"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/03/16/3864655/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりあえず今年食べたモノでイチバン美味しかったの何？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えーなんだろ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/03/16/3864655/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とらぢっていう焼肉屋さんに行ったんだけどそこのカルビがとろけるかと思った❤❤❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生まれてから一番聴いた曲って何？\n思い付いたので聞いてみました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BIGBANGのファンタスティックベイビーかな (๑╹∀╹๑)ほぼ毎日聞いてる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私、北海道に住んでるんだけど\nあみあみは来たことあるー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あるよあるよ！！！\nちはると、全国キャンペーンで行った"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/03/16/3864655/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・東京でオススメのお店教えて!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"食べ物かな？\nだったらやっぱり原宿のエッグスシングス❤あと新宿にあるビタースウィーツ❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までしたことのない格好でいつかしてみたい格好は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん～、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ナースのコスプレとかしてみたいかも(^_-)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみあみは何の匂いが好きですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみは、バニラとかココナッツとか好きだなー❤\nでも春にココナッツはちょっとしつこいから、さわやかな香りがいいなと思う。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみあみ☆が一番、白いごはんに合うと思うおかずは何ですか\n僕は『桃屋のメンマ やわらぎ』です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やわらぎ！？おいしそー！！\nあみはね、食べるラー油"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/03/16/3864655/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おいちいのよ。あとはカクテキかなー  (๑･ิټ･ิ๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここまでー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/03/16/3864655/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"公式サイトのプロフィール写真変わってたね！\nあみの顔、なんか伸びてた。笑"}],"source":"archive"}